{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52335","headline":"诗（幷序） 九十六 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 九十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百姓被欺屈，三官须爲申。\n朝朝团坐入，渐渐曲精（戴、项校「情」）新。\n断榆翻作柳，判鬼却爲人。\n天子抱冤屈，他於（张改作「扬」）陌上尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}